ly performs chamber music, and the performance and educational endeavor Now Musique. His 12 solo albums have earned over 13 million streams, and he has several publications of John Cage, Alan Hovhaness, and contemporary composers. Born in Oklahoma, raised in Colorado he makes his home in Boston where he is on faculty at the New England Conservatory.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://alcguitar.com/\" target=\"_blank\">ALCGuitar.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://youtube.com/aaronlcguitar\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/aaronlcguitar</a></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
